#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explore IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog, abstracted circuit function and "
"application function services designed to accelerate research and "
"application prototyping."
msgstr ""
"IBM Qiskit Functions "
"Catalogを探索しましょう。研究およびアプリケーションのプロトタイピングを加速するために設計された、抽象化されたCircuit "
"FunctionおよびApplication Functionサービスです。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Functions"
msgstr "Qiskit Functionsの概要"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/functions.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/functions.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Jarman, HIVQE, Cadavid, Chandarana, Leclerc, Sachdeva, HUBO, Filippov, Downfolding, Aharonov, Mundada, Yamauchi, supersymmetric, Paterakis, Gharibyan, Jaffali, Pellow */}\n"
